'''''Hero, Honor That Crimson Call''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[For the Sun is Set to Die]].

==Steps==
# Talk to the Guard, and meet up with Dan Heng
# Meet up with Dan Heng
# Escape from Amphoreus
# Watch March 7th's experience
# Head to the Vortex of Genesis and complete the Era Nova with Phainon
# Complete the Era Nova with Phainon
# Complete Era Nova
# Watch "Immersive Theater"

