===Escape from Amphoreus{{subst:void|<!--104050103-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; EnterDistrict_G68_2)
:'''Dan Heng:''' The Flame Reaver isn't pursuing us... Could this really be some kind of divine intervention?
::'''Mnemosyne the Guard:''' We can't stay here for long. Lady Trinnon's Century Gate is just outside the city &mdash; let's keep moving.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I still feel like someone should stay behind...
:::'''Dan Heng:''' I agree. But Phainon... he must have struggled a lot before making this decision.
:::Is this... really what Trailblazing is supposed to be?
:::'''Dan Heng:''' Our experience in Amphoreus has far exceeded expectations. If our goal was just to replenish fuel, then mission accomplished. But you're right...
:::Leaving like this... I'll definitely regret it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this... really what Trailblazing is supposed to be?
:::'''Dan Heng:''' Our experience in Amphoreus has far exceeded expectations. If our goal was just to replenish fuel, then mission accomplished. But you're right...
:::Leaving like this... I'll definitely regret it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Leaving like this... I'll definitely regret it.
::'''Dan Heng:''' I... feel the same. Someone should stay and help Phainon complete Era Nova.
::'''Dan Heng:''' ...
::'''Dan Heng:''' For now, let's get back in contact with the Express and plan our next move. That's the safest course of action. We need more information.
::'''???:''' On that note, I have a proposal&mdash;
::'''Zeph the Guard:''' ...Who's there!?
::'''Screwllum:''' I hope to convey a message to the two "Nameless."
::'''Dan Heng:''' Mr. Screwllum!?
::'''Mnemosyne the Guard:''' Who are you!? Stand down! I order you to maintain a distance of ten paces!
::'''Dan Heng:''' It's okay, guard. This one is not our enemy.
::'''Screwllum:''' It has been a while, Nameless of the Astral Express.
::'''Screwllum:''' I'm glad I arrived in time to stop that black-clad one from harming you further.
::'''Dan Heng:''' So, it was you.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's good to see some familiar faces.
:::'''Screwllum:''' It was fortunate we found you in time. Madam Herta and I were both quite relieved, (Trailblazer).
:::Never thought the Express Crew would bring in a genius for backup...
:::'''Screwllum:''' Indeed. Madam Herta invited me to meet with you Nameless. Rest assured, (Trailblazer).
:::Things are getting more confusing by the minute...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Never thought the Express Crew would bring in a genius for backup...
:::'''Screwllum:''' Indeed. Madam Herta invited me to meet with you Nameless. Rest assured, (Trailblazer).
:::Things are getting more confusing by the minute...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Things are getting more confusing by the minute...
::'''Screwllum:''' Rest assured, (Trailblazer). Madam Herta and I have come here for the sake of Amphoreus.
::'''Zeph the Guard:''' You two know this... Antikytheran? Does he come from the same people as Councilor Lygus?
::'''Dan Heng:''' Don't worry, guard. This gentleman is an ally of the Trailblaze. Would you mind giving us a moment to speak in private?
::'''Zeph the Guard:''' Of course. We'll wait nearby. Please stay safe.
::'''Screwllum:''' I fully understand your situation. For now, the only thing I can do is temporarily freeze that black-clad one in place. Time is limited. So, I'll keep this brief&mdash;
::'''Screwllum:''' The place where you stand, Amphoreus, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|is a world constructed from data and memoria, an experimental field of a certain Aeon.}}
::'''Screwllum:''' And now, this isolated sandbox world is rapidly falling into a third Path &mdash; {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Destruction}}.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Destruction...
::'''Screwllum:''' Conclusion: If Amphoreus continues unchecked on this course...
::'''Screwllum:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|A Lord Ravager will complete its evolution and metamorphosis, and emerge from the surging tides. The cosmos as we know it will suffer irreversible consequences.}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A Lord Ravager... Like Phantylia?
:::'''Screwllum:''' The disaster that this Lord Ravager intends to trigger may be far more severe than the Luofu's Stellaron Crisis. Because its goal is...
:::A cosmic-scale disaster?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A cosmic-scale disaster?
::'''Screwllum:''' Affirmative. If everything unfolds toward the worst possible outcome as predicted, the consequences will be unimaginable. Because the Lord Ravager's goal is...
::'''Screwllum:''' {{Rubi|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|The Aeon of Erudition}}|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Nous}}}}.
::'''Dan Heng:''' ...
::'''Screwllum:''' Putting aside the complex details of the inferences involved, I have a request to make, for one of you Nameless, to stay behind on Amphoreus, acting as an informant, in order to prevent the wrath of Destruction from ravaging the cosmos.
::'''Screwllum:''' This world is enveloped in a "firewall" that defies explanation, and the flow of time here is also different from reality. Madam Herta and I can only tear open a gap and project images inside.
::'''Screwllum:''' However &mdash; the accidental crash landing of the Express Car notwithstanding &mdash; both of you were able to successfully land here. There must be some principle behind this we have yet to fully grasp.
::'''Screwllum:''' It will take time to uncover the reason. Before then, if one of the Nameless is willing to stay and witness the fate of this world &mdash; or to push it along when necessary &mdash; it would be of great assistance.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I will shoulder this responsibility.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Two people can stay.
:::'''Screwllum:''' There are reasons for which I must recommend against such a course of action.
:::What say you, Dan Heng?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What say you, Dan Heng?
::'''Dan Heng:''' ...
::'''Dan Heng:''' Mr. Screwllum, I believe you, so I only have one thing I'd like to confirm with you. As Amphoreus is already facing its end, how can we guarantee the safety of the person who stays behind?
::'''Screwllum:''' Look at this, if you would&mdash;
::{{tx}}
